# Codex container egress allowlist.
#
# Include the shared development destinations, then append Codex-only
# endpoints when a reviewed workflow requires them. Each host carries an
# inline triage rationale; see
# docs/runbooks/devcontainer-tool-network-triage.md.
@include shared.allowlist
api.openai.com  # OpenAI API endpoint used by the Codex CLI at runtime.
auth.openai.com  # ChatGPT-mediated OAuth token exchange during `codex login`.
